0_AQB3o7paxcdHy0mevGcaD_j6FGYqwaousYK21UuuVk96eg&oe=6A56598B"}, {"file_name": "ApplicationFrameHost_HK4eDEJa05.png", "id": "2259053614549439", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820167_2259053621216105_4697871030252040617_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YWdJX6TdXqwQ7kNvwFwD2J5&_nc_oc=AdqzZJjFw2r15WyftAKv-bDGVwvsINjzF81__0D5PjvCEAyHk-gj-S1qcJEg2osiMNQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQChWM8QYVaclwKMPvU5FZlOebcSnAuGaTD46k64qOFl4Q&oe=6A562517"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "1_2560x1440-Trailor_Socialvalue_ver-001.png", "id": "992457893004769", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393406_992457896338102_7378945432206573156_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0CkvZ_t0XTkQ7kNvwHsNz99&_nc_oc=AdpzsH7eIrWgmZRM-DOPmQBL2WHcTr6UEunVPyHBK3XtbOiCnX5u1GKFTauOnCHOZqY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDzFS9MSGPVdR3A38hMrknSDyIGuTSjohL8bN3RjVa-TA&oe=6A5646F7"}, "display_name": "Cultural life - Taking the Bus", "keywords": ["Cognitive", "Bus", "Disability", "simulation"], "long_description": "1. Tap the Guess the route button, read the route map, and select the appropriate route.\n2. Tap the Board button, select the bus route you must take, and wait for the bus.\n3. Tap Don't ride button if it's not the bus you need, or tap Board if it is.\n4 . Board the bus and pay with your card. \n5. Press the Get off button, and when you get on the bus, find the get off bell, press it, and wait.\n6. Hold your card up to the reader to pay", "short_description": "In this content, you will practice riding a bus in virtual reality. Check the route, wait for the bus, board, pay with your card, and train until you get off. The content is designed to help you improve your skills by repeatedly practicing and mastering it. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://training.contentsda.kr/privacy